# Raging River: as Bot1 attacks with Memnite and Crimson Kobolds, Bot2 divides its creatures without flying - Phyrexian Walker
# "left", Kobolds of Kher Keep "right"; Ornithopter has flying and is in no pile, and Bot1's own Crookshank Kobolds, which stays
# home, is not Bot2's to divide - and only then does Bot1 label Memnite "left" and Crimson Kobolds "right". Each pile blocks
# only the attacker of its label, Ornithopter either one for its flying, and Zealous Guardian, cast with flash after the
# ability resolved, in no pile at all, neither (the rulings; CR 509.1b). The restriction lasts only this combat: it is
# gone by the second main phase.
[Bot1 Deck]
Raging River
Black Lotus
Memnite
Crimson Kobolds
Crookshank Kobolds
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Phyrexian Walker
Kobolds of Kher Keep
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Zealous Guardian
Island
Island
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Raging River.Cast
? Bot1.Mana = {R}
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Crimson Kobolds.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Crookshank Kobolds.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Phyrexian Walker.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Kobolds of Kher Keep.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2; Crimson Kobolds > Bot2)
Bot2.Choose(Phyrexian Walker)
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Phyrexian Walker.BlockRestriction = In the "left" pile
? Bot2.Battlefield.Kobolds of Kher Keep.BlockRestriction = In the "right" pile
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.BlockRestriction = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Crookshank Kobolds.BlockRestriction = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.BlockRestriction = Can't be blocked except by creatures with flying and creatures in a "left" pile; Labelled by Raging River
? Bot1.Battlefield.Crimson Kobolds.BlockRestriction = Can't be blocked except by creatures with flying and creatures in a "right" pile; Labelled by Raging River
Bot2.Hand.Zealous Guardian.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Pass
! Bot2.Block(Phyrexian Walker > Crimson Kobolds)
! Bot2.Block(Kobolds of Kher Keep > Memnite)
! Bot2.Block(Zealous Guardian > Memnite)
! Bot2.Block(Zealous Guardian > Crimson Kobolds)
Bot2.Block(Phyrexian Walker > Memnite; Ornithopter > Memnite; Kobolds of Kher Keep > Crimson Kobolds)
? Combat.Blocks.Count = 3
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Zealous Guardian.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.BlockRestriction = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield.Phyrexian Walker.BlockRestriction = (absent)
Bot2.Life = 20
